      "Id": "41dced036c45411fa9ad49fa5a2a1325",
      "Name": "Log",
      "Type": "string",
      "InitialValue": "=== Volumen MDT v26 ===\n\nContornos: 9\nEstilo picking: 'Standard'\n  Volumen_MDT_Zona01: C1213 R692 r1.75\n  Volumen_MDT_Zona02: C706 R1122 r0.63\n  Volumen_MDT_Zona03: C712 R113 r6.31\n  Volumen_MDT_Zona04: C116 R185 r0.63\n  Volumen_MDT_Zona05: C540 R767 r0.70\n  Volumen_MDT_Zona06: C9527 R9774 r0.97\n  Volumen_MDT_Zona07: C4259 R1512 r2.82\n  Volumen_MDT_Zona08: C680 R315 r2.16\n  Volumen_MDT_Zona09: C379 R473 r0.80\n\n9 volumenes creados.\nZona 01: tabla en (362124.7, 4666780.4)\nZona 02: tabla en (362124.7, 4666740.4)\nZona 03: tabla en (362124.7, 4666700.4)\nZona 04: tabla en (362124.7, 4666660.4)\nZona 05: tabla en (362124.7, 4666620.4)\nZona 06: tabla en (362124.7, 4666580.4)\nZona 07: tabla en (362124.7, 4666540.4)\nZona 08: tabla en (362124.7, 4666500.4)\nZona 09: tabla en (362124.7, 4666460.4)\n\n>>> 9 tablas + restaurar estilo encolados.\n\n=== COMPLETADO ===",
